<view class="page">
  <view class="eyebrow">local-shop · 多商户店面</view><view class="title">进店看看，把需求说清楚</view>
  <view class="notice">当前为开发版。真实微信登录、扫码、消息与隐私流程尚未验收；不提供支付功能。</view>
  <view class="error" wx:if="{{error}}">{{error}}</view>
  <view class="card" wx:if="{{devAllowed}}"><view class="subtitle">开发店铺入口</view>
    <input placeholder="输入完整店铺编号（开发验证）" value="{{storeInput}}" bindinput="input" maxlength="36" />
    <button bindtap="enter" disabled="{{busy}}">进入本店</button>
    <view class="muted">分享入口会直接定位对应店铺。无效入口不会跳到其他店。</view>
  </view>
  <view class="card" wx:if="{{!devAllowed && !recent.length}}"><view class="subtitle">从商家分享进入店铺</view><view class="muted">请打开商家分享的店铺链接。暂不支持全平台搜店；没有入口时可以直接联系熟悉的商家。</view></view>
  <view class="card" wx:if="{{recent.length}}"><view class="subtitle">最近浏览</view>
    <button wx:for="{{recent}}" wx:key="id" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="enter">{{item.name}}</button>
  </view>
  <view class="card"><view>身份：{{identity}}</view>
    <block wx:if="{{devAllowed}}"><picker range="{{aliases}}" value="{{aliasIndex}}" bindchange="chooseIdentity"><view class="field">开发身份：{{aliases[aliasIndex]}}</view></picker>
      <button bindtap="signIn" disabled="{{busy}}">进入受控开发身份</button></block>
    <block wx:else><button bindtap="wechatLogin" disabled="{{busy}}">微信登录</button><view class="muted">浏览店铺无需登录；本项目接入未配置时会明确提示，不使用演示身份。</view></block>
    <button bindtap="signOut" disabled="{{busy}}">退出身份</button>
    <view class="muted">切换身份不会带入其他人的草稿、私图或历史。登录令牌仅保存在内存。</view>
  </view>
  <view class="card" wx:if="{{!devAllowed && identity!=='未登录'}}"><view class="subtitle">确认自己的Web工作台登录</view><view class="notice">只输入自己正在打开的工作台所显示的确认码。不要代他人确认，确认后该网页可使用你的已有权限；不会新增管理员权限。</view><input value="{{approvalCode}}" bindinput="approvalInput" maxlength="12" placeholder="12位工作台确认码" disabled="{{busy}}"/><checkbox-group bindchange="approvalCheck"><label><checkbox value="confirmed" checked="{{approvalConfirmed}}" disabled="{{busy}}"/>这是我本人正在发起的工作台登录</label></checkbox-group><button bindtap="approveBrowser" disabled="{{busy || !approvalConfirmed}}">明确确认这次登录</button></view>
  <button bindtap="capabilities" disabled="{{busy}}">查看本项目接入状态</button><view class="notice" wx:if="{{capabilities}}">{{capabilities}}</view>
  <button bindtap="invitations" disabled="{{busy}}">查看本人开店邀请／账号编号</button><button bindtap="workbench" disabled="{{busy}}">进入商户工作台</button>
</view>
